  "title": "Wintrust Financial Corporation Reports Record Net Income",
  "summary": "ROSEMONT, Ill., July 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Wintrust Financial Corporation (“Wintrust”, “the Company”, “we” or “our”) (Nasdaq: WTFC) announced record net income of $461.1 million, or $6.52 per diluted common share, for the first six months of 2026 compared to net income of $384.6 million, or $5.47 per diluted common share, for the same period of 2025. This represents a year-to-date net income increase of 20% compared to the same period of 2025. Pre-tax, pre-provision income (non-GAAP) for t",
